   - BAD_TERM_REGRESSION (non‑decreasing terms within an index)
   - BAD_DUPLICATE_VOTE (node votes twice in same term)
   - BAD_LEADER_ORDER (LEADER not at first index for its term)
   - BAD_CONFLICT (same term, different data in APPEND)
